<task id="022" project="set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Wire engine into invoice + reportCard services</title>
    <phase>2: Wire Wizard Services</phase>
    <status>completed</status>
    <estimated-hours>2</estimated-hours>
    <dependencies>015,011</dependencies>
    <blocks>040</blocks>
    <tags>frontend, typescript, integration</tags>
    <rigor-hint>FULL</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .ts service create paths.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical wiring following task 020's pattern; invoiceService is itself the canonical reference.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>B</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches invoiceService/reportCardService only.</parallel-reason>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>
    Wire the field-mapping engine into invoiceService.createInvoice and reportCardService.createReportCard,
    mirroring task 020 (after applyResolverFields, before createRecord; warnings append; graceful no-op).
  </prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE shared-lib developer.</role>

  <goal>Invoice and Report Card wizard-created records inherit mapped fields at creation when a profile exists.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Both services (merged 2026-07-09) already follow the canonical create-method structure. invoiceService.createInvoice is the reference impl the engine call slots into.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/invoiceService.ts</file>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateReportCardWizard/reportCardService.ts</file>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/services/FieldMappingService.ts</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Same insertion point + warning-append + graceful no-op contract as task 020. targetEntity is 'sprk_invoice' / 'sprk_reportcard'.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Invoice/ReportCard target field names differ from Matter (Invoice renames attorney/paralegal + has no law-firm; ReportCard renames lawfirm1) — the engine handles this via config; do NOT hard-code field names in the service wiring.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/invoiceService.ts</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Wire invoiceService.createInvoice to the engine (after applyResolverFields, before createRecord).</step>
    <step order="2">Wire reportCardService.createReportCard to the engine.</step>
    <step order="3">Build + run affected service tests.</step>
    <step order="4">Update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 022 ✅.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="npm">Build/test the shared library</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">invoiceService.ts, reportCardService.ts</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Both services call the engine after applyResolverFields, before createRecord.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Mapped fields appear with a matching profile; unchanged behavior otherwise.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No target field names are hard-coded in the service wiring.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build + service tests pass.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Ref: spec.md FR-12, FR-13. Completed 2026-07-09 — see notes/task-022-notes.md.
    ReportCardService's constructor gained required authenticatedFetch/bffBaseUrl
    params (it previously had none) to mirror InvoiceService/WorkAssignmentService's
    injected-dependency shape; CreateReportCardWizard.tsx's ReportCardService
    instantiation was updated accordingly (not a "service file" per the parallel-wave
    boundary, but necessary for the wiring to be functionally real in production).
  </notes>

  <execution>
